message: "If you use or reference this research, cite it as below."
title: "PandoSI: elastically scalable, heterogeneous, self-replicating unified intelligence"
authors:
  - name: "JewelRoam"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/JewelRoam/PandoSI"
abstract: >-
  A heterogeneous decision ensemble that composes floor-tier neural models,
  self-trained fine-tunes, and remote LLM tiers into one gated system across
  machines, operating systems, and NAT boundaries. Every headline number is
  traceable to a recorded run in the research log.
